00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.690
Some things are more important. It's where the rock are.

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:29.340
Well, I, I, you're welcome.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.460
And I got something for you!

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:34.520
Plastic pellets! My favorite!

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:38.220
Ha! Adds so much potential, don't you think?

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:39.440
Thanks, Wanda.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:41.440
Funny thing about doing something nice,

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:44.080
it's the kind of thing that's easy to recycle.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:49.930
Recycling is the gift that keeps on giving.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:52.090
Oh, sing it, Murphmeister.

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:57.230
Cause life ain't gonna be worth living.

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:06.330
We'll just throw the world away.

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:07.530
No, no!

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.630
What goes around comes around again.

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:14.800
It's on giving.

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:19.320
Visa! Visa!

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.290
Because if we don't, then it'll flash.

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:24.270
The world will be a big heap of trash.

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:26.740
What goes around again.

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:28.090
You better, girl!

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:29.230
Yeah, what goes around again.

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:31.040
Okay
